# Cursor C++ style for this repo.
# Mechanical formatting follows the Google C++ Style Guide:
# https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html
# clang-format's Google preset is that guide's formatting subset
# (2-space indent, 80 columns, pointers left, braces attached).
#
# Do not bulk-reformat the existing BID C sources. Run clang-format on
# new or touched C++ files only.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
...
